    {
      "id": "dock-power",
      "text": "## 夜班装卸台\n纸鹤仓的装卸台触控屏变灰时，请先查看电源盒指示灯。蓝灯常亮应重插屏幕信号线，灯灭应报修电源盒。\n## 消毒排班\n装卸台每周四收班后消毒，夜班无需填写额外表单。",
      "metadata": {
        "source_url": "fixture://rag-independent-v1/dock-power",
        "scenario": "dock",
        "access": "employee",
        "status": "active",
        "source": "dock-power.md",
        "version": "1",
        "valid_to": "2099-12-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "locker-hold",
      "text": "鹿灯园的冷藏寄存柜显示 HL-6 时代表温度未达标。领取人须等待面板显示“准许领取”再刷卡。",
      "metadata": {
        "source_url": "fixture://rag-independent-v1/locker-hold",
        "scenario": "locker",
        "access": "employee",
        "status": "active",
        "source": "locker-hold.md",
        "version": "1",
        "valid_to": "2099-12-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "exhibit-live",
      "text": "## 展签停在旧版\n鹭纹厅的电子展签在换展后仍显示旧内容时，先在展陈台点击“重送批次”，然后核对屏幕右下角的批次号。\n## 展签灯带\n电子展签的装饰灯带由闭馆定时器控制。",
      "metadata": {
        "source_url": "fixture://rag-independent-v1/exhibit-live",
        "scenario": "exhibit",
        "access": "employee",
        "status": "active",
        "source": "exhibit-live.md",
        "version": "1",
        "valid_to": "2099-12-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "exhibit-audio",
      "text": "鹭纹厅的语音导览机换展后仍播旧内容时，在讲解台点击“重送音轨”。仅适用于耳机导览。",
      "metadata": {
        "source_url": "fixture://rag-independent-v1/exhibit-audio",
        "scenario": "exhibit",
        "access": "employee",
        "status": "active",
        "source": "exhibit-audio.md",
